      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Mission 4 - \u201Cdigging deeper\u201D\n\nwe have located the rough location
    of the enemy central hive, but the underground tunnels span for hundreds of kilometers
    in all directions. to find the core, we will need to scan the tunnel network.\n\nwe
    set up a series of sonars that will help us achieve this. but as soon as we activated
    them, their seismic disturbance called in endless swarms of bugs, destroying
    the defending forces.\n\nmove into the area, secure each sonar pod by keeping
    your sonar pack in a close enough radius around each pod.\n\nonce we have triangulated
    the hives core, we will hopefully be able to eliminate the bugs for good."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a42a157b2e6473f4697c7fd42d38f9b4, type: 2}
